        <mxCell id="p1x0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;Nordvia finance ontology - usage schema&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;What the knowledge graph actually holds (119,299 triples). The number in a class is how many instances it has." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="60" width="700" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1x1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ellipse: class. Rectangle: datatype. Rounded box: the individuals of a class (owl:oneOf for closed lists, rdf:type otherwise).&lt;br&gt;Hollow arrow: rdfs:subClassOf; every document, customer, payee and account is typed with its most specific class." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2500" y="60" width="560" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1x2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Instance IRIs&lt;/b&gt;  https://nordvia.com/id/…&lt;br&gt;document/1000-1800000045-2025 · line-item/1000-1800000045-2025-001&lt;br&gt;company/1000 · account/0000140000 · cost-center/… · customer/0000100027 · payee/0000200069&lt;br&gt;posting-key/01 · document-type/DR" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2500" y="170" width="560" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1x3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Declared but not populated&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;nvf:TaxCode and nvf:taxCode are in the ontology; no line item in the graph carries a tax code.&lt;br&gt;nvf:DebtAgeBucket is not linked from any instance: competency question 1 reads its day ranges to place each open item." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2500" y="1790" width="560" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
